; z80dasm block file for bank 13 @ 0xA000. Rendering only; bank is not code.
; Several tables are 60/61 words indexed by (0xE242) (1-based; [0] sentinel).
; Packed gems / actors / tools / screens / links / pickups / doors are source.
; afb1_tbl is 60 words indexed by level-1 (no sentinel); packed tools -> 0xE300.
; ba57[0] == 0xBA61; bb38[0] == 0xBB3C.
a75d_tbl:  start 0xA75D end 0xA7D7 type worddata
aae0_tbl:  start 0xAAE0 end 0xAB5A type worddata
ab5a_flags: start 0xAB5A end 0xAD3A type bytedata
adcf_tbl:  start 0xADCF end 0xAE47 type worddata
